        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="background-color: #f5f5f5;">Current year distributions were $71,562,000 which exceeded unappropriated retained income by $11,125,670 as of June 30, 2026. Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
